  "description": "<p>If no <a href=\"https://fcrepo.github.io/fcrepo-specification/#dfn-ldprm\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">LDPRm</a> is appropriate to the Accept-Datetime value, an implementation should return a 406 (Unacceptable).</p>\n\n<p>To reproduce: </p>\n\n<p>1. create an LDPRv:</p>\n\n<p>curl -X PUT <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/versioned_resource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/versioned_resource</a> </p>\n\n<p>2. Perform get on the resource with Accept-Datetime header</p>\n\n<p>curl -v -X GET <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/versioned_resource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/versioned_resource</a>  -H \"Accept-Datetime: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 GMT\"</p>\n\n<p>Confirm the result is 404 (there are no LDPRm).  The status should be 406 according to the spec (section 4.1.1)</p>",
